constraints:
1 ≤ N ≤ 10^{18}

expected time complexity: O(N)
expected auxiliary space: O(1)

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def idToShortURL(self, n):
		char_set = 'abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ0123456789'
		base = len(char_set)
		ans = []
		while n:
			(n, rem) = divmod(n, base)
			ans.append(char_set[rem])
		return ''.join(ans[::-1])
